# Proposal: chat-frontend UI Redesign

## Intent
Premium, distinctive chat UI that *shows* real-time backend features (Socket.IO live updates, typing, notifications) and meets WCAG AA (keyboard + SR).

## Scope
### In Scope
- Tailwind v4 design system: CSS-first `@theme` tokens (OKLCH), semantic colors, radii, focus rings, motion tokens.
- Realtime UX: message streaming, optimistic send, connection/retry state, typing indicator (chat list + active thread), unread/mention badges.
- Notifications UX: in-app toasts + Web Push permission/subscription flow + settings (quiet hours).
- Accessibility: landmarks, roving tabindex in chat list, SR-friendly message semantics, `prefers-reduced-motion`.

### Out of Scope
- Backend contract changes.
- New sync semantics beyond existing backend.

## Capabilities
### New Capabilities
- `ui-design-system`: tokens + component variants.
- `chat-realtime-ux`: Socket.IO lifecycle + UI states (typing/connectivity/live updates).
- `notifications-ux`: toast + push permissions/subscriptions + settings.
- `accessibility-chat-ui`: WCAG AA patterns for list/thread/composer.

### Modified Capabilities
- None.

## Approach
Exploration proposed **Inter** + **Violet/Indigo**; both conflict with premium guardrails (Inter + “AI purple” risk). Two enterprise-grade directions (pick one and commit):
- **Alt A — Industrial Quiet**: Zinc neutrals + single Emerald accent; status-first, no glow.
- **Alt B — Warm Graphite**: Slate neutrals + Deep Rose accent; editorial hierarchy, tactile controls.

Skill contract:
- `design-taste-frontend`: strict component boundaries; GPU-safe animations (`transform/opacity`); isolate motion-heavy leaf components.
- `frontend-design`: one bold cohesive direction; avoid template layouts; intentional asymmetry.
- `tailwind-design-system`: tokens + CVA variants; semantic utilities; dark mode via v4 patterns.

## Affected Areas
| Area | Impact | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `src/styles/*` | Modified | v4 tokens, dark mode, focus styles |
| `src/components/ui/*` | New | primitives (Button/Input/Dialog/Toast) |
| `src/features/chat/*` | Modified | ChatList/Thread/Composer redesign + typing |
| `src/lib/socket/*` | New/Modified | Socket adapter + reconnect handling |
| `src/lib/notifications/*` | New | toast + push helpers |

## Risks
| Risk | L | Mitigation |
|---|---:|---|
| Event drift (typing/unread) | Med | Adapter layer + mocked contract fixtures |
| Push annoyance | Med | Opt-in, granular toggles, quiet hours |
| Motion harms a11y/perf | Low/Med | Reduced-motion + GPU-safe only |

## Rollback Plan
Ship behind `uiRedesign` runtime flag. Keep old UI for 1 release; rollback by flag off.

## Dependencies
Backend event schema + push subscription/VAPID readiness.

## Success Criteria
- [ ] Typing indicator in list + thread within 200ms of event.
- [ ] Live updates + reconnect UI (no refresh).
- [ ] WCAG AA audit passes; full keyboard/SR flows.
- [ ] Push flow optional and reversible.
